Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}玩截流的兄弟们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:02.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}我刚刚发现一个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:03.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}特别{\c&H0057C8FF&\fscx100\fscy100\t(0,140,\fscx108\fscy108)}不要{\c&H00F8FAFC&\fscx100\fscy100}脸的玩法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:04.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}像以前我们去截流
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:05.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}都是找同行的作品
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:06.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}看到同行评论
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.78,0:00:07.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}区有咨询的客户
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:09.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}就一个一个的去打招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.34,0:00:11.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}现在已经是AI的时代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.04,0:00:12.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}很多老板全在用AI去跑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.64,0:00:13.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}操作也非常简单
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:15.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}把同行的链接放上去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.52,0:00:16.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}输入行业{\c&H0057C8FF&\fscx100\fscy100\t(0,140,\fscx108\fscy108)}关键{\c&H00F8FAFC&\fscx100\fscy100}词
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.82,0:00:18.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}让AI去帮你找那些刚刚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.50,0:00:19.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}评论的客户就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:20.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}你只需要设置
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:21.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}好打招呼的话术
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.70,0:00:23.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}让AI去打招呼就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.06,0:00:24.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}玩截流的都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:24.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)}找到客户的
